@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide stereotype

actor Evaluator
actor "Developer/Operator" as Dev

node "Docker Container" as Docker {
  node "ROS Environment" as ROS {
    node "ROS Master" as ROSMaster

    package "Perception Subsystem" as Perception {
      component "Traffic Light Detector\n(tl_detector)" as TLDet
    }

    package "Planning Subsystem" as Planning {
      component "Waypoint Loader\n(waypoint_loader)" as WPLoader
      component "Waypoint Updater\n(waypoint_updater)" as WPUpdater
    }

    package "Control Subsystem" as Control {
      component "Twist Controller\n(twist_controller)" as TwistCtrl
      component "Drive-By-Wire Node\n(dbw_node)" as DBW
    }

    interface "/current_pose" as T_current_pose
    interface "/base_waypoints" as T_base_waypoints
    interface "/traffic_waypoint" as T_traffic_waypoint
    interface "/final_waypoints" as T_final_waypoints
    interface "/twist_cmd" as T_twist_cmd
    interface "/vehicle_cmd" as T_vehicle_cmd

    artifact "launch/styx.launch" as StyxLaunch
    artifact "launch/site.launch" as SiteLaunch
  }
}

cloud "Udacity Simulator" as Simulator
artifact "Recorded Training Bag\n(rosbag play)" as Bag

frame "Simulator Mode" as SimFrame {
  Simulator
  StyxLaunch
}
frame "Site Mode" as SiteFrame {
  Bag
  SiteLaunch
}

Dev --> StyxLaunch : start simulator mode
Dev --> SiteLaunch : start site mode
Evaluator --> Simulator : observe simulator session
Evaluator --> Bag : observe site-mode playback

StyxLaunch --> ROSMaster : start nodes/config
SiteLaunch --> ROSMaster : start nodes/config

Simulator --> T_current_pose
Bag --> T_current_pose

WPLoader --> T_base_waypoints

TLDet --> T_traffic_waypoint

T_current_pose --> WPUpdater
T_base_waypoints --> WPUpdater
T_traffic_waypoint --> WPUpdater
WPUpdater --> T_final_waypoints

T_final_waypoints --> TwistCtrl
T_current_pose --> TwistCtrl
TwistCtrl --> T_twist_cmd
DBW --> T_vehicle_cmd
T_twist_cmd --> DBW

T_vehicle_cmd --> Simulator

note right of T_base_waypoints
twist.twist.linear.x carries target top speed.
Control must not exceed this upper bound.
end note

note right of TLDet
Detect and classify traffic lights on real images during site-mode playback.
Publish stop-related waypoint when red/yellow requires stopping.
end note

note bottom of Docker
Environment prerequisites:
- Docker installed
- ROS launched inside container
Launch entry points:
- launch/styx.launch
- launch/site.launch
end note
@enduml
